**Files changed:**

- [ClinicalCatalogModels.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/model/catalog/ClinicalCatalogModels.kt): Added pure functions `applyLabCategoryGroupEdit` and `applyMedicationItemEdit`, and declared `updateLabCategoryGroup` and `updateMedicationCatalogItem` on `LabCatalogDelegate` and `MedicationCatalogDelegate`.
- [ClinicalCatalogRepository.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/model/catalog/ClinicalCatalogRepository.kt): Implemented `updateLabCategoryGroup` and `updateMedicationCatalogItem` and updated `loadCatalogData` to load stored lists deduplicated by ID (keeping the last) instead of duplicating edited defaults on restart.
- [strings.xml](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/res/values/strings.xml): Added string resource keys `edit_diagnostic_panel`, `create_diagnostic_panel`, and `edit_medication_title` without em dashes.
- [CatalogSettingsSections.kt](file:///Users/sherifgamalradwan/anc-emr-android-native/app/src/main/java/com/sherifradwan/ancnative/ui/CatalogSettingsSections.kt): Added 48dp edit icon buttons with test tags `editLabGroupBtn-<id>` and `editMedCodexBtn-<id>`, and updated panel and medication dialogs to accept an initial item, display edit titles, and invoke update on save.
